Package name:     rjenkins
Version number:   1.0
Original author:  Bob Jenkins <rjenkins@cs.berkeley.edu>
Report bugs to:   ftp@hpux.ask.uni-karlsruhe.de
Tested on:        HP 9000/720 running HP-UX 8.07 or 9.03
Purpose:
Computation of the HOMFLY polynomial. The algorithm works by dynamic
programming. The normal approach creates a binary tree (each node an
intermediate knot; all the leaves unlinks).
Date archived:    Fri 10 Jun 1994
Special notes:  Test: homfly borromean.txt
                Compile this with gcc! HPUX9 cc apparently does not handle
                certain expressions correctly.
